Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Heart only: the lines readers are given say what Heart
 does

The 1.9 note's listening line (and its copies in entries.json and
patches.json) no longer says every text is read aloud: Heart has
recorded none beside the Bible yet. The drop loses that also line and
its two copies (the App Store's text, Community's post); its voices step
and its never list say the phone's voices are gone and the Plus voices
dropped. The FAQ says the New Testament is read aloud, not every
chapter of the Bible, in 21 languages. The Voice sheet's ten strings
are gone from the 21 catalogs. Round 3's record says screen 7 is
dropped; held.patch stays. heartOnlyLines.test.ts holds all of it.

